# Learning Insights

This directory contains project-specific insights discovered through learning analysis.

Insight files will be created automatically as patterns emerge.

---

## Expected Files

- `component-insights.json` - Component-specific learnings
- `technology-insights.json` - Technology stack insights
- `integration-insights.json` - Integration patterns
- `performance-insights.json` - Performance optimizations

---

## Note

Files are created on-demand. An empty directory is normal for new projects.
